From 13212df66d94a1690801ee6dd9764d6284b8e91c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:01:51 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Show 10 events per page and allow choosing per_page

Closed list [5, 10, 20] for ?per_page= (default 10). The Paginator keeps
extra query params, passed through Model::paginate, so page links keep
per_page.
---
